A person's code is an intimate look into his mind. You will not be judged :-)

That said- here are some suggestions:
Try printing all required objects (spm?) with put() and not print() so that we can recreate your objects more easily.

Adhere to some programming style guide, such as Google's:
https://google-styleguide.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/Rguide.xml
You will find that your code is more readable for others and yourself.

On a more operational level:
- I would try restarting R or cleaning the workspace so that you are certain that you do not have historical garbage objects that result in unexpected behavior.
- Try
 for (i in as.charachter(sp_names)){ ...

